1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,867
The last stanza repeats the first four lines word for word.

2
00:00:03,867 --> 00:00:06,848
It is not laziness; it is a test.

3
00:00:06,848 --> 00:00:09,752
Play the opening again, and see what has changed.

4
00:00:09,752 --> 00:00:18,307
Now the old guard hold a regal parade, and heralds announce her name: the establishment is opening its ranks to honour her.

5
00:00:18,307 --> 00:00:24,882
And at that very moment, the wish to follow men warped in her, twisted out of shape like damp wood.

6
00:00:24,882 --> 00:00:29,622
The final image is an absence: the homage was left waiting for me.

7
00:00:29,622 --> 00:00:32,213
No speech, no slammed door.

8
00:00:32,213 --> 00:00:33,828
She is simply elsewhere.

